 triggers:{filename:'whatflow-flow-triggers.jpg',alt:'WhatFlow trigger picker in Shopify Flow showing incoming WhatsApp events',caption:'WhatFlow Business API in the Shopify Flow demo store: merchant-facing incoming-message triggers. This is a configuration screenshot, not evidence of a completed customer interaction.'},
 actions:{filename:'whatflow-flow-actions.jpg',alt:'Shopify Flow action picker listing WhatFlow WhatsApp message actions',caption:'WhatFlow message actions available in the demo store’s Shopify Flow editor. Message type and customer-service-window rules still apply.'},
 orderReply:{filename:'whatflow-flow-order-reply.jpg',alt:'Inactive Shopify Flow example branching on a WhatsApp order reply and adding an order tag',caption:'Inactive demo workflow: a WhatsApp order reply is checked before an order tag is added. The screenshot does not show a live order being changed or fulfilled.'},
 routing:{filename:'whatflow-flow-text-routing.jpg',alt:'Inactive Shopify Flow example using an incoming WhatsApp message and a condition to choose a reply',caption:'Inactive demo workflow: an incoming WhatsApp text message is evaluated before a response action. Review the condition and recipient mapping before enabling your own version.'},
 template:{filename:'whatflow-flow-template-mapping.jpg',alt:'WhatFlow Send WhatsApp Template configuration in Shopify Flow with template and recipient fields',caption:'WhatFlow template action in the demo Flow editor. Template names and variable choices must match the approved template in your own account.'},
 ecosystem:{filename:'whatflow-flow-ecosystem.jpg',alt:'Shopify Add order tags action mapped to the order supplied by a WhatFlow reply workflow',caption:'Inactive demo: Shopify’s Add order tags action uses order.id from the WhatFlow order-reply event. Other app blueprints require their own compatible connectors and setup.'},
 sidekick:{filename:'whatflow-flow-sidekick.jpg',alt:'Shopify Sidekick assisting with a plain-language request for an inactive WhatFlow workflow',caption:'Sidekick-assisted demo workflow. AI-generated steps need review; the demonstration is kept inactive and does not send customer messages.'},
 actionsMore:{filename:'whatflow-flow-actions-more.jpg',alt:'Scrolled WhatFlow action picker showing WhatsApp template, text and video actions',caption:'The rest of the message-action list in the actual Flow editor, including the text and video actions. Free-form actions require an active customer-service window.'},
 routingFields:{filename:'whatflow-flow-text-fields.jpg',alt:'WhatFlow text-message action with recipient mapped from the incoming sender and a sample delivery reply',caption:'Inactive demo: Recipient Phone Number uses fromPhoneNumber. The 3–5 business day text is a sample policy, and replying TEAM does not itself assign a teammate.'},
